                                                "sense_id": "0b5ef05c-75c0-3de3-bc0e-53a2a55ead67",
                                                "text": "To strew the laureate hearse where Lycid lies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9aedd582-7c37-40ff-9303-22f444dca8bb",
                                                "sense_id": "0b5ef05c-75c0-3de3-bc0e-53a2a55ead67",
                                                "text": "Soft on her lap her laureate son reclines."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae927201-5b7f-40ef-a5a7-b89396b630e2",
                                                "sense_id": "0b5ef05c-75c0-3de3-bc0e-53a2a55ead67",
                                                "text": "Although the post of poet laureate as we know it was not established until John Dryden's appointment in 1668,"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
